Module bout "A fight that is not to the death: lads with their fists, a pit-fighter, a band of footpads that breaks" {
  Place strand "the strand" is room at 0, 0 outdoors.
  Place slip "the slip" is room at 1, 0 outdoors.
  Place yard "the yard" is room at 2, 0 outdoors.
  Place lane "the lane" is room at 3, 0 outdoors.
  Passage up "the way up the slip" between strand and slip.
  Passage over "the way over to the yard" between strand and yard.
  Passage on "the way on to the lane" between strand and lane.
  Company party "You" of 1 at strand.
  Person lads "the Cawse lads" at strand { Role "three young men with their fists". Ancestry human. Calling commoner.
    Level 1. Numbers 3. Pronouns they. Refuge slip.
    Pleads "The Cawse lads back off with their hands up, bleeding, and go off up the slip.". }
  Initially Assert yields(lads).
  Person bruiser "the pit-fighter" at yard { Role "a pit-fighter with fists like hams". Ancestry human. Calling warrior.
    Level 9. }
  Initially Assert yields(bruiser).
  Person pads "the footpads" at lane { Role "four footpads". Ancestry human. Calling commoner. Level 1. Numbers 4.
    Pronouns they. }
  Initially Assert breaks(pads).
  Rule lads_bested when routed(lads) and not bested(party) says "Up on the slip somebody laughs at them." { Assert bested(party). }
  Relation bested(group).
}
